{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018900/extras/Mov1ie_004.gif?t=1741244667\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a twin-stick shooter in the style of The Binding of Isaac.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Enemy Base producing zombies was found in the Desert and Arctic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our hero, a MiniTank, was sent on a mission to destroy this Base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the mission, there will be no help from the headquarters, so the player must repair the tank and find upgrades on their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades can be purchased at upgrade stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player will need to find and clear all zombie production stations and the enemy headquarters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018900/extras/20304__1_.gif?t=1741244667\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018900/extras/10304__1_.gif?t=1741244667\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018900?t=1741244667","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741244667","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018900/b42cf0983b9464a07df4670b5af4529b7182b468/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741244667","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018900/b42cf0983b9464a07df4670b5af4529b7182b468/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741244667","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descr